{"seq":2,"slug":"routing","title":"路由与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/routing","wordCount":1087,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由与懒加载\">路由与懒加载</h1><p>路由把浏览器地址栏变成应用状态的一部分：URL <code>/users/42/orders</code> 不只是个字符串，它声明了「此刻该渲染用户 42 的订单视图」。Angular 路由器负责把这种 URL 到组件树的映射做出来——匹配路径、解析参数、加载并挂载对应组件、处理嵌套与守卫。而懒加载是路由最有杠杆的能力：让一条路由对应的代码只在用户真正访问时才下载，这是控制首屏体积最直接的手段。本篇讲清路由配置、懒加载、函数式守卫与解析器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>路由配置是一个 <code>Routes</code> 数组，每条 <code>Route</code> 把一个 <code>path</code> 模式映射到要渲染的组件（或要懒加载的代码），并可附带参数、守卫、解析器、子路由。路由器解析当前 URL，自上而下匹配这个数组，命中后把组件渲染进对应的 <code>&lt;router-outlet&gt;</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[URL 变化] --&gt; B[路由器匹配 Routes 数组]&#10;  B --&gt; C{命中路由}&#10;  C --&gt;|有守卫| D[canMatch canActivate 校验]&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E{懒加载?}&#10;  D --&gt;|拒绝| R[重定向或拦截]&#10;  C --&gt;|无守卫| E&#10;  E --&gt;|loadComponent| F[下载代码块 chunk]&#10;  E --&gt;|已加载| G[解析器 resolve 预取数据]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[渲染进 router-outlet]\">flowchart TD\n  A[URL 变化] --&gt; B[路由器匹配 Routes 数组]\n  B --&gt; C{命中路由}\n  C --&gt;|有守卫| D[canMatch canActivate 校验]\n  D --&gt;|通过| E{懒加载?}\n  D --&gt;|拒绝| R[重定向或拦截]\n  C --&gt;|无守卫| E\n  E --&gt;|loadComponent| F[下载代码块 chunk]\n  E --&gt;|已加载| G[解析器 resolve 预取数据]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[渲染进 router-outlet]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>path</code></td>\n<td>URL 匹配模式</td>\n<td><code>&#39;users/:id&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>component</code></td>\n<td>直接渲染的组件</td>\n<td><code>UserComponent</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loadComponent</code></td>\n<td>懒加载单个独立组件</td>\n<td><code>() =&gt; import(&#39;./x&#39;).then(m =&gt; m.X)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loadChildren</code></td>\n<td>懒加载一组子路由</td>\n<td><code>() =&gt; import(&#39;./routes&#39;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>canActivate</code> / <code>canMatch</code></td>\n<td>进入守卫</td>\n<td><code>[authGuard]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolve</code></td>\n<td>渲染前预取数据</td>\n<td><code>{ user: userResolver }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>children</code></td>\n<td>嵌套子路由</td>\n<td>配合子 <code>&lt;router-outlet&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"配置路由与参数\">配置路由与参数</h2><p>路由用 <code>provideRouter(routes)</code> 在引导时注册（取代旧的 <code>RouterModule.forRoot</code>），这与 <a href=\"modules-standalone\">模块与独立组件</a> 讲的函数式 provider 一脉相承。路径可带参数：<code>:id</code> 是路径参数，<code>?</code> 后是查询参数。新一代 Angular 推荐用信号化的输入直接接收路由参数——开启 <code>withComponentInputBinding()</code> 后，路由参数会自动绑定到组件的同名 <code>input()</code> 信号，省去手动订阅 <code>ActivatedRoute</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export const routes: Routes = [&#10;  { path: &#39;&#39;, component: HomeComponent },&#10;  { path: &#39;users/:id&#39;, component: UserComponent },&#10;  { path: &#39;**&#39;, component: NotFoundComponent }, // 通配兜底&#10;];&#10;&#10;bootstrapApplication(AppComponent, {&#10;  providers: [provideRouter(routes, withComponentInputBinding())],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 组件里直接用信号接收 :id，无需订阅 ActivatedRoute&#10;export class UserComponent {&#10;  id = input.required&lt;string&gt;(); // 路由参数自动绑定&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, component: HomeComponent },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users/:id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, component: UserComponent },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, component: NotFoundComponent }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通配兜底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bootstrapApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AppComponent, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providers: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">provideRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(routes, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withComponentInputBinding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件里直接用信号接收 :id，无需订阅 ActivatedRoute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由参数自动绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种「路由参数即输入信号」的写法把路由数据顺滑接入了第二章 <a href=\"../reactivity/signals\">Signals 响应式</a> 的响应图：<code>id</code> 一变，依赖它的 <code>computed</code> 与 <code>resource</code> 自动重算重取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"懒加载-按需下载代码\">懒加载：按需下载代码</h2><p>默认情况下，路由配置里直接 <code>component:</code> 引用的组件会被打进首屏包。<code>loadComponent</code> 和 <code>loadChildren</code> 用动态 <code>import()</code> 把组件或子路由拆成独立代码块（chunk），只在路由首次命中时才下载。独立组件让这件事的粒度细到单个组件——过去只能懒加载整个 <code>NgModule</code>，现在能懒加载一个组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export const routes: Routes = [&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;admin&#39;,&#10;    loadComponent: () =&gt; import(&#39;./admin/admin.component&#39;).then((m) =&gt; m.AdminComponent),&#10;    canMatch: [adminGuard], // 守卫不通过则连代码都不下载&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;shop&#39;,&#10;    loadChildren: () =&gt; import(&#39;./shop/shop.routes&#39;).then((m) =&gt; m.SHOP_ROUTES),&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    loadComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./admin/admin.component'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.AdminComponent),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    canMatch: [adminGuard], </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 守卫不通过则连代码都不下载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    loadChildren</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./shop/shop.routes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SHOP_ROUTES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>canMatch</code> 守卫与懒加载配合有个微妙好处：守卫不通过时，连那条路由的代码块都不会下载——这比 <code>canActivate</code>（先匹配、加载、再拦截）更省。懒加载是首屏性能的主杠杆，更系统的体积优化见 <a href=\"../advanced/performance\">性能优化</a>。配合预加载策略（<code>withPreloading</code>），还能在首屏空闲时悄悄预取可能用到的懒路由，兼顾首屏小与跳转快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"函数式守卫与解析器\">函数式守卫与解析器</h2><p>守卫决定「能不能进这条路由」，解析器负责「进之前先把数据备好」。Angular 现在推荐函数式写法——守卫和解析器就是普通函数，运行在注入上下文，因而能直接 <code>inject()</code> 所需服务。这比旧的基于类、要实现接口的守卫简洁得多，其能 <code>inject()</code> 的原理正是第一章 <a href=\"../foundations/dependency-injection\">依赖注入</a> 讲的注入上下文。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 函数式守卫：返回 true / false / UrlTree（重定向）&#10;export const authGuard: CanActivateFn = (route, state) =&gt; {&#10;  const auth = inject(AuthService);&#10;  const router = inject(Router);&#10;  return auth.isLoggedIn() ? true : router.parseUrl(&#39;/login&#39;);&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 函数式解析器：渲染前预取，组件用输入信号接收&#10;export const userResolver: ResolveFn&lt;User&gt; = (route) =&gt; {&#10;  const id = route.paramMap.get(&#39;id&#39;)!;&#10;  return inject(UserService).getUser(id);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 函数式守卫：返回 true / false / UrlTree（重定向）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> authGuard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CanActivateFn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> auth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AuthService);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> router</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Router);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auth.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isLoggedIn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/login'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 函数式解析器：渲染前预取，组件用输入信号接收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> userResolver</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResolveFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route.paramMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserService).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>守卫有几类：<code>canMatch</code>（影响路由是否匹配，配懒加载省下载）、<code>canActivate</code>/<code>canActivateChild</code>（进入校验）、<code>canDeactivate</code>（离开校验，比如「有未保存修改，确定离开？」）。解析器的取舍要权衡——它会延迟导航直到数据就绪，体验上是「点了链接稍等再切页」；很多场景更适合先切页、组件内用 <code>resource</code> 边显示骨架边加载（见 <a href=\"../reactivity/signals\">Signals 响应式</a>）。此外，路由的 <code>providers</code> 字段能在路由子树创建一个环境注入器子节点，实现路由级的状态隔离——这一作用域机制在 <a href=\"../foundations/dependency-injection\">依赖注入</a> 已有说明，是按功能区隔离 <code>SignalStore</code> 的常用手法，参见 <a href=\"../advanced/state-management-ngrx\">状态管理：NgRx</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路由把 URL 映射到组件树分支：<code>Routes</code> 数组按序匹配 <code>path</code>，命中后渲染进 <code>&lt;router-outlet&gt;</code>，支持参数、守卫、解析器、嵌套子路由。</li>\n<li>用 <code>provideRouter</code> 注册；开启 <code>withComponentInputBinding()</code> 后路由参数自动绑定到组件 <code>input()</code> 信号，无需订阅 <code>ActivatedRoute</code>。</li>\n<li><code>loadComponent</code>/<code>loadChildren</code> 用动态 <code>import()</code> 按需下载代码块，独立组件让懒加载粒度细到单组件，是首屏性能主杠杆。</li>\n<li>函数式守卫与解析器是推荐写法，运行在注入上下文可直接 <code>inject()</code>；<code>canMatch</code> 配懒加载能在拒绝时连代码都不下载。</li>\n<li>路由 <code>providers</code> 创建路由子树的环境注入器子节点，实现路由级状态隔离，常用于按功能区隔离状态存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由与懒加载","id":"路由与懒加载"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"配置路由与参数","id":"配置路由与参数"},{"level":2,"text":"懒加载：按需下载代码","id":"懒加载-按需下载代码"},{"level":2,"text":"函数式守卫与解析器","id":"函数式守卫与解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模块与独立组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/modules-standalone"},"next":{"title":"表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/forms"}}